001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          SDEACCS.
001300 AUTHOR.              KURT MOVSESIAN.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        APRIL 27,1981.
001700
001800
001900******************************************************
002000*                                                    *
002100*   MP4   MODIFY ACCOUNTING DATA - THIS PROGRAM      *
002200*         ALLOWS DEPT, EXPENSE CLASSES, AND NEW      *
002300*         WORK CODES TO BE ADDED AND DELETED FROM    *
002400*         THE DATA BASE                              *
002500*                                                    *
002600******************************************************
002700
      *C 07/20/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 6238
      *C    1. CHANGED ZDEACC BY ADDING SCREENS FOR COMPANY,
      *C       PRIME, AND CLASS.  ALSO ADDED DELETE CONFIRMATION
      *C       FOR ALL DELETE SCREENS.
      *C    2. ADDED LOGIC TO ADD AND DELETE COMPANY AND PRIME
      *C       DATA TO MVALIDPLTDATA
      *C    3. ADDED LOGIC TO ADD, EDIT, AND DELETE CLASS
      *C       DATA IN MCLASS. (SIMILAR TO CSAS DATA)
      *C
      *C 07/20/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 6238
      *C    1. CHANGED ZDEACC BY ADDING LINKAGE ABILITY TO
      *C       DEACC1A (DEPARTMENT ADD).
      *C    2. ADDED LOGIC TO EDIT LINKAGE AND WRITE TO DB.
      *C    3. ADDED FIELD TO MVALIDPLTDATA TO HOLD LINK -
      *C       VALID-DATA-CO-PR  X(6)
      *C
      *C 06/01/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQUEST #6507
      *C    ALLOW WITHDRAWAL RESTRICTIONS TO BE PLACED ON
      *C    ACCOUNTING CLASS.  CHANGED ZDEACC TO INDICATE
      *C    WHICH FUNCTION KEY TO PRESS TO ACCESS THE
      *C    RESTRICTIONS AND CHANGED THIS PROGRAM TO CALL
      *C    THE SUBROUTINE SRWADD TO ACCESS THE RESTRICTIONS
      *C    WITH A RESTRICT-TYPE OF "C" FOR CLASS.
      *C
      *C 08/15/94  WILL MCINTYRE  REQUEST #93-030
      *C    REVISED ZDEACC TO ALLOW FOR MAINTENANCE OF A FLAG
      *C    IN THE CLASS DATABASE WHICH DETERMINES WHETHER THE
      *C    SELECTED CLASS WILL BE ELIGIBLE FOR INVENTORY
      *C    TURNOVER REPORTING.
      *C
      *C 04/30/02  CA YODER    R3 REQUEST
      *C    FOR PLANTS ON R3, ONLY ALLOW ENTRY OF CERTAIN RANGES
      *C    OF NEW WORK (SAP INTERNAL ORDER #) CODES.  CURRENTLY,
      *C    THESE RANGES ARE 500000 - 599999 AND 800000 - 899999.
      *C    ALSO, CHANGE SCREEN REFERENCES TO "NEW WORK" NUMBERS
      *C    TO "SAP INTERNAL ORDER" NUMBERS FOR SAP/R3 PLANTS.
      *C
      *C    IF THESE RANGES ARE CHANGED, CHANGE THE VALUES IN
      *C    VALID-SAP-NUM.  ALSO, MESSAGE #09115 IN MCFP000100
      *C    WILL NEED TO BE CHANGED TO REFLECT THE VALID RANGES.
      *C
005090
005100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
005400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDEACC-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MVALIDPLTDATA-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
005500
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MCLASS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MCLASS-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DRESTRICT
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS5001
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

005600 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC.
           05  FILLER              PIC X(1000).

       FD  MVALIDPLTDATA-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MVALIDPLTDATA-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS1701.

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  MCLASS-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCLASS-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS4901.

       FD  MCLASS-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCLASS-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS4901.

       FD  DRESTRICT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRESTRICT-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS5001.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       77  TEN-THOUSAND               PIC X(6)   VALUE "010000".
       77  ONE-THOUSAND               PIC X(6)   VALUE "001000".
       77  RESTRICT-TYPE              PIC X(1)   VALUE "C".
       77  SAVE-REQ-SYNR3-SW          PIC X(1).

      *---------- VALID SAP INTERNAL ORDER NUMBER RANGES.
       01  SAP-NUM                    PIC 9(6).
           88  VALID-SAP-NUM   VALUES ARE
                                      500000  THRU  599999
                                      800000  THRU  899999.

