141120*          FOR ALL PLANTS.   -D.A. PLUM.            *
141130*                                                   *
141200*   FOR 129 (UNION CITY) EXPENSE CLASS MUST BE LESS *
141300*       THAN 001000                                 *
141400*   FOR 629 (VALLEYFIELD) AND 630 (NEW TORONTO),    *
141410*       AND 126 (DANVILLE)                          *
141500*       THERE ARE NO LIMIT RESTRICTIONS. ALSO FOR   *
141600*       THESE PLANTS, THE EXPENSE CLASS CAN HAVE    *
141700*       ALPHA CHARACTERS.                           *
141800*   FOR ALL OTHER PLANTS EXPENSE CLASS MUST BE LESS *
141900*       THAN 010000                                 *
142000*                                                   *
